<title>USA: Michigan, won by First of America.</title>
<headline>Michigan, won by First of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America said it won $22.760</p>
<p>million of State of Michigan, comprehensive transportation refunding</p>
<p>bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 5.421 percent.</p>
</text>
